{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/remote/remote_flows.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T06:22:27.534782Z","id":"189f34dab50afe8a7cc94a2c27e18fc3b48478c96a0a3fa01326cad2d33cef77","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:805847ffe","summary":"Fixed in 805847ffe. Test: apps/clax_app/test/ui/remote_flows_test.dart (Unpublish and Tell @owner offline and too old, offline modelled as 502 remote_unreachable) and apps/clax_app/test/ui/library_screen_test.dart (out of reach / too old) (//apps/clax_app:ui_remote_flows_test, //apps/clax_app:ui_library_screen_test). bazelisk test of the 30 touched //apps/clax_app test targets with //apps/clax_app:dart_analyze and //scripts:check_copy at b93c4d42f: 'Executed 25 out of 32 tests: 32 tests pass.' Mutation: with the sources put back to their parent, 2 remote_flows tests and 1 library test fail.","supersedes":"a5478ac476290ff452f4a4df22c1efc5eae88cf7c11e0f3ad95b06e9d00b9ac3","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
