{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/remote/remote_card.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T06:22:28.549244Z","id":"f5a13259a95b6da4663e12288088dd390df7b4ef10b5e8c25c1b366668f254ff","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:8415bef0e","summary":"Fixed in 8415bef0e. Test: apps/clax_app/test/ui/remote_card_test.dart 'a published app shows its copy, Live, …' (the pill's icon under ExcludeSemantics, words 'Live') and test/ui/versions_tab_test.dart versions_tab_marks_public (cloud icons, words 'public'/'was public') (//apps/clax_app:ui_remote_card_test, ui_versions_tab_test); remote-card shots at phone 200% show the pill beside the title. bazelisk test of the 30 touched //apps/clax_app test targets with //apps/clax_app:dart_analyze and //scripts:check_copy at b93c4d42f: 'Executed 25 out of 32 tests: 32 tests pass.' Mutation: with remote_card.dart or versions_tab.dart put back to their parent, the matching test fails.","supersedes":"242476dd60ddd40f6fc7ff0ee6dd3068e2f81ffaf7b838b458f21f0f7af77b03","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/remote/share_sheet.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T06:22:28.625379Z","id":"9292fa6f43bc9e1e1f535457734049cf7e8f62834448c272d8a8410d56ba70e1","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:e549a9ad6","summary":"Fixed in e549a9ad6. Test: apps/clax_app/test/ui/share_sheet_test.dart 'each access picker tells a screen reader what it sets' and test/ui/versions_tab_test.dart versions_tab_marks_public ('Publish version 2') (//apps/clax_app:ui_share_sheet_test, ui_versions_tab_test). bazelisk test of the 30 touched //apps/clax_app test targets with //apps/clax_app:dart_analyze and //scripts:check_copy at b93c4d42f: 'Executed 25 out of 32 tests: 32 tests pass.' Mutation: with share_sheet.dart put back, or the Publish semanticsLabel removed, the matching test fails.","supersedes":"8de3211a9d30c5a3bd18f341d3d28b7f5d5060e6cf8aee65c585070e3a657b81","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/remote/remote_card.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T18:31:09.859391Z","id":"8866ac75523188e3f10903886c8837f797a9df88aedcf247d79814f89af49c00","body":{"detail":"RemoteCard reads RemoteFlows.headOf on initState and when the link's base changes. 404 shows 'No longer on <host>'; other failures show no pill. A shared, cached linked-app checker would let the card, the launcher and update offers agree.\nRe-anchored unchanged from mailto:alex@kesling.co (session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a)'s record.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":140},"end":{"line":153},"content_hash":"ef8994c1fc99f6475ec7da678362697743194c462d85c46be81d1b7065766371"},"summary":"The On clax.dev card reads the head once per show; it does not poll, and its pill is the sync state computed here, not a shared checker's","supersedes":"2ae1a6f6591e0c99a1db7712682a6576456d5a9a7b64b1fb1f94d255e8a4f07e","tags":["area:remote","session:claude-code:985c579c-9fcb-4f5b-b70f-deedb4f3ea58"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/remote/remote_card.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T18:31:09.955420Z","id":"4247810b744a880f2e412135cd5edf46f055e07c4e3b8ae31d87d4e3cb208a6b","body":{"detail":"With no newer bundle waiting, the way back to Live is restoring the release in Versions or the next update. A card action that reinstalls the kept release (Take the public vN) is not built.\nRe-anchored unchanged from mailto:alex@kesling.co (session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a)'s record.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":232},"end":{"line":239},"content_hash":"13937bb80d29a83c3e87d198f7d10367f2fa081e60e4b8567095b5f5f2c7705a"},"summary":"A recipient's fork has no 'Take the public vN' (reset) on its card; only Publish fork…","supersedes":"984cae3d9dfa4ddaedb1e684ad4b410a9973632060f848bcbf2c742f6a0ffa44","tags":["deferred","session:claude-code:985c579c-9fcb-4f5b-b70f-deedb4f3ea58"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/remote/remote_flows.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T18:31:10.048810Z","id":"c7931e38709e5b4d6fe4667f1f5afbc51e85808d1592128db7a09d1d091f40ec","body":{"detail":"_connected(origin: link.remoteOrigin) finds no remote at that origin and calls the connect hook, which in lib/app.dart (_connect) always signs in to https://clax.dev. The answer is not at the link's origin, so `!at(r)` returns null and RemoteFlows.publish ends with no message (test/ui/remote_flows_test.dart 'a sign-in at another origin is not taken for a linked app' asserts that nothing is shown). Failure: an app got through clax:get?url=https://other.example/a/<id> (lib/platform/bundle_intake.dart artifactOf), then Publish to clax.dev… from its menu: the person signs in to clax.dev, or, signed in already, sees nothing at all.\nRe-anchored unchanged from mailto:alex@kesling.co (session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a)'s record.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":127},"end":{"line":135},"content_hash":"242b006b02744e1250137aac74af5e759ae7752d03d528e189fca6193371eebc"},"suggested_fix":"Pass the link's origin to the connect hook, or show 'Sign in to <host> first' (or the Refused for a recipient link) instead of returning silently.","summary":"Publish of an app linked at a hosted Clax other than clax.dev runs the clax.dev sign-in, then silently does nothing","supersedes":"5574367630807ce93fc633d708b6afefa5c27ba92bc17def11203c2a7270b9ef","tags":["area:remote","session:claude-code:985c579c-9fcb-4f5b-b70f-deedb4f3ea58"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/remote/remote_flows.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T18:31:10.139298Z","id":"fa88a48faa9f460a33d1cde1a5b168117c3abe5a3d56c8f8fdfe7e861e3282be","body":{"detail":"lib/remote/models.dart Remote has id, origin, name, status and personName only. A display name with spaces reads oddly after '@'. Needs the core's remote record to carry the account login.\nRe-anchored unchanged from mailto:alex@kesling.co (session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a)'s record.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":195},"end":{"line":195},"content_hash":"acc0aa885f08b710c337e56ac200052c19e2cd335cc6d701ee56a84832fc637e"},"summary":"The publish sheet's \"as @login\" shows Remote.personName, the account's display name: Remote carries no login","supersedes":"3d0754961f02e911e6d20559ea1a4d68de3d4f7bd599c72235957d7ecdc5c4b8","tags":["review","area:remote","session:claude-code:985c579c-9fcb-4f5b-b70f-deedb4f3ea58"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/remote/remote_flows.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T18:31:10.230086Z","id":"87447ad1ed212de5000ee550db1358f778661c049d9accd22a4e3f260d2b3f64","body":{"detail":"An account that can comment only through the copy's link ('Anyone with the link can comment') holds no share. Its copy is missing from remote.apps(rid), so access stays null and Tell @owner is hidden, although spec 2026-10-21-app-push-pull §5.7 offers it to anyone who may comment. FakeRemoteApi.comment checks the copy's access, so the tests cannot see the gap.\nRe-anchored unchanged from mailto:alex@kesling.co (session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a)'s record.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":567},"end":{"line":584},"content_hash":"e3c290ce32908318026321da73f25e2c1812157b06241f3a6f80abd05d930077"},"suggested_fix":"Read the caller's effective access from the head (or a route that answers it) instead of the apps list.","summary":"Tell @owner reads a non-author's right to comment from GET /api/remotes/{rid}/apps, which lists only owned and shared apps","supersedes":"123a68c83e4fd297aaaa6a492c7dc122112b8254c1728ff07e2037c3a168ddcc","tags":["review","session:claude-code:985c579c-9fcb-4f5b-b70f-deedb4f3ea58"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/remote/remote_flows.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T18:31:10.325326Z","id":"c073646f786dc06eed56b2d5965f5e5315307e25ab0b6ce7669fe4bdef295531","body":{"detail":"Publisher keeps a pending upload as AppLink.pendingBundle plus the file <support>/publishing/<aid>.clax (apps/clax_app/lib/remote/publisher.dart:199-200). RemoteFlows.unpublish sets the link to null without Publisher._drop, and forgetDeleted (apps/clax_app/lib/bundle/installer.dart) forgets the entry without the file. Publisher.resume only visits entries whose link holds a pending bundle, so nothing deletes the file again: up to 32 MiB per app stays in the support directory.\nRe-anchored unchanged from mailto:alex@kesling.co (session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a)'s record.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":736},"end":{"line":746},"content_hash":"fcfa0848d4ed1efe3887bbb18f4eb3ae984f64a5cd617404ff982f46f235871f"},"suggested_fix":"Delete <support>/publishing/<aid>.clax in unpublish (through a Publisher method) and in forgetDeleted; resume can also sweep files whose app has no pending record.","summary":"Unpublish and app deletion leave a pending bundle's bytes in <support>/publishing/<aid>.clax for good","supersedes":"9675cb14f6af7758c76cd6ce8c0a572ab579b06a927020903795901c21c36b07","tags":["review","lifecycle","disk","session:claude-code:985c579c-9fcb-4f5b-b70f-deedb4f3ea58"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/remote/share_sheet.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T18:31:10.418108Z","id":"aa796b24e80f85277bc516473622ff5970218e00f0de1249f4a84f07d1568019","body":{"detail":"share-model.ts has no COMMENTS_LABEL or COMMENTS_NOTE on this branch; docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-21-app-push-pull.md Task 6 (line 317) names them: COMMENTS_LABEL = \"Comments\", COMMENTS_NOTE = {on: \"People who can comment may comment.\", off: \"Off: nobody can comment, whatever their access.\"}. commentsLabel and commentsNote here copy those. When Task 6 lands, check the two still match word for word.\nRe-anchored unchanged from mailto:alex@kesling.co (session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a)'s record.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":52},"end":{"line":58},"content_hash":"3bdc6093428c30dd4d0c89294b81ddccf4c6968b3ed998a8b367b94d266187c2"},"summary":"The Comments switch's words are not in web/shell/src/ui/share-model.ts yet: taken from the plan's COMMENTS_LABEL and COMMENTS_NOTE","supersedes":"7d3fd136f494ec45307ae9bf6ec43c3dcc06e1dcef84bf4703069f1b2cc74570","tags":["sharing","copy","app-push-pull","session:claude-code:985c579c-9fcb-4f5b-b70f-deedb4f3ea58"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/remote/share_sheet.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T18:31:10.514640Z","id":"9a6d6e33bb65026c11a9ef7ff6e0b45ba52306d098b16ed7fa2a3632052ecbaa","body":{"detail":"Commenting out `if (named.length > 1) return null;` (share_sheet.dart:134) left //apps/clax_app:ui_share_sheet_test passing. Failure under that mutation: with two suggestions both named \"Sam\", typing Sam and tapping Add shares with the stranger GitHub login `sam` instead of saying \"Type a GitHub login, such as @octocat, or pick someone.\"; web/shell/src/ui/share-model.ts subject() refuses it.\nRe-anchored unchanged from mailto:alex@kesling.co (session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a)'s record.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":124},"end":{"line":141},"content_hash":"a1c3f736535dc0038814c1a5c16cdd7d4f35acf02ce2bab29c5906e2a6ee2b0a"},"suggested_fix":"A widget test with two candidates of one name: Add refuses and calls no share.","summary":"No test pins that a name two suggested people share is refused rather than taken as a GitHub login","supersedes":"0ea00e81e2d5ea01f6c9826229be129b4284914e828ed1c93cb7a685f2ceccd6","tags":["review","tests","sharing","app-push-pull","session:claude-code:985c579c-9fcb-4f5b-b70f-deedb4f3ea58"]}}
